 search (a hashtag in my messages / public posts) the worker keeps searchesStorage[key] while held and answers the same search later from it, without messages posted since. Fix: key computed once, held once per search in the loader's owner, released on its cleanup. Round 2: createLoadableList moved out of statistics.tsx into @helpers/solid/createLoadableList (statistics re-exports it for its other importers) so topbarSearch and the regression test do not pull the statistics tab; the test uses pause.","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"morethanwords/tweb","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:08:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"2e5ef7a21031343cd72a1781f975fe0cfe12f036","github_link":"https://github.com/morethanwords/tweb/commit/2e5ef7a21031343cd72a1781f975fe0cfe12f036","commit_subject":"Contacts: a failed contacts.getContacts no longer leaves its waiters hanging","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"morethanwords/tweb","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:08:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"2b878cf64c244c080e76905a170ea5adad9eaf6c","github_link":"https://github.com/morethanwords/tweb/commit/2b878cf64c244c080e76905a170ea5adad9eaf6c","commit_subject":"Profile: a basic group's member made an admin keeps who added them","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"morethanwords/tweb","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:08:52Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"95f0076dbea8f00207f772ebb167e46975aca743","github_link":"https://github.com/morethanwords/tweb/commit/95f0076dbea8f00207f772ebb167e46975aca743","commit_subject":"Chats: a group's changed restrictions reach the tabs' copy of it and the kept copy","ai_tool":"Claude"},{"repo_name":"morethanwords/tweb","commit_timestamp":"2026-11-02T16:08:51Z","branch":"master","commit_sha":"5bb04660e27beb7183ed2ddab14bfa229eccc733","github_link":"https://github.com/morethanwords/tweb/commit/5bb04660e27beb7183ed2ddab14bfa229eccc733","commit_subject":"Stories viewer: the minute poll of the viewed stories stops when the viewer closes","ai_tool":"Claude"},